WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.005 --> 00:00:09.310
Managing projects — Create a project manually, switch between projects, archive one (restorable) or delete it permanently.

2
00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:14.646
The start screen lists your projects — or create one manually without an SRS.

3
00:00:14.646 --> 00:00:19.305
The same step-by-step wizard, with a blank draft.

4
00:00:22.217 --> 00:00:27.731
On the project home, Archive project and Delete project sit right before Switch Project.

5
00:00:27.731 --> 00:00:31.684
Archiving hides the project but keeps all its data.

6
00:00:31.684 --> 00:00:37.448
Archived projects are listed on the start screen — Restore brings one back.

7
00:00:39.678 --> 00:00:44.538
Delete is permanent — the dialog lists what goes and offers Archive instead.

8
00:00:44.538 --> 00:00:51.417
Gone — the project and all its data. Only the owner can archive or delete a project.
